/-!
# x-mutable (13 Oct 2026): the E7 kernel check with mutable sources (`eCheckZ`)

Nil Mamano's `eCheck` / `ERun` / `eCheck_sound` (`Work/Gauge/ECheck.lean`, mirror of Jacob Sussman's `yCheck`), word
for word, with the replay `gItemsZ` (gate kinds `okAZK` / `okBZK`).  E7: a gauged slot never reaches a target.
Generated by text substitution (x-mutable/tools/make_echeckZ.py).  No `sorry`.
-/

set_option linter.unusedSectionVars false
set_option linter.unusedVariables false
set_option linter.unusedSimpArgs false
